        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Social Distortion, Wolf Parade, Agent Orange\n- People: Brent Harold Liles\n- Places: Fullerton, California, Montreal, Quebec, British Columbia\n- Topics: punk rock, indie rock, band formation, band membership\n\nFacts:\n- Social Distortion is an American punk rock band that was formed in 1978 in Fullerton, California.\n- Brent Harold Liles was born on September 7, 1963.\n- Brent Harold Liles was the bassist for Social Distortion from 1981 to 1984.\n- Wolf Parade is an indie rock band that was formed in 2003 in Montreal, Quebec, and its musicians are from British Columbia.\n- Brent Harold Liles was the bassist for Agent Orange from 1988 to 1992.\n- Brent Harold Liles died on January 18, 2007.",
